Package: ausparl
Title: Query the Australian Parliamentary Hansard Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Guangnan", "Zhu", email = "Guangnan.Zhu@anu.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Basic, reproducible query access to the pre-built Australian
    Hansard 'DuckDB' database: filtered access to sittings, speeches and
    members, full-text term search, date-scoped context joins, activity
    summaries, and hand-off to text analysis tools. The database is opened read-only and is not shipped with
    the package; a small sample database is bundled for examples and tests.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/Australian-Parliamentary-Speech/ausparl
